Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:05.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:05.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:07.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:07.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:12.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't comment without violating our agreement that I not criticize your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.46,0:00:12.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能有所评论 因为这会违反不能批评你的协议
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:17.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Then what was "Oh, boy"? -Great restraint on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:17.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真糟糕是什么意思？ -我极力在忍耐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:20.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's nothing wrong with the science here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:20.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这在科学上并没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:24.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Perhaps you mean a different thing than I do when you say "science."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.31,0:00:24.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许当你说科学时 跟我所指的科学不同
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:33.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:33.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这样如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You actually had it right in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 你一开始是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:41.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Once again, you've fallen for one of my classic pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:41.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再一次 你又掉入 我典型的恶作剧陷阱里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Buzzinga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:50.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, now, here's a peculiar e-mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.09,0:00:50.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里有个罕见的电子邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:54.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The president of the university wants me to meet him at his office at 8 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:54.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大学校长要我早上八点 到他办公室见他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:57.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Why? -Doesn't say. Must be an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.68,0:00:57.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-为什么？ -没说 一定是急事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:01:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone at the university knows I eat breakfast at 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:01:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}学校里大家都知道我八点吃早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:03.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and move my bowels at 8:20.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:03.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}8点20分排便
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, how did we live before Twitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 推特出现前 我们是怎么过日子的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:11.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess you'll find out what it is in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:11.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想 明天一早你就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's 14 hours away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还要再等14小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:17.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For the next 840 minutes, I'm effectively one of Heisenberg's particles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.45,0:01:17.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}接下来的840分钟 我简直就是海森伯格所说的粒子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:20.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know where I am or how fast I'm going, but I can't know both.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:20.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道我在哪里或速度多快 却不能两者得兼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:22.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yet how am I supposed to carry on...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:22.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}脑子里盘旋着这件恼人的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:25.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with this huge annoying thing hovering over my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:25.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么正常生活呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:27.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:55.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard. Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.74,0:01:55.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:56.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:56.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:59.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, it's 2:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:59.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 现在是凌晨两点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:03.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why does everybody keep telling me what time it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:03.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为何大家都一直告诉我现在几点钟？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Everybody? -You, the president of the university...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:06.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-大家？ -你 大学校长…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:08.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...his wife, their sullen teenage daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:08.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他太太 还有他们脸色不善的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That entire family is fascinated by what time it is and whether people know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.84,0:02:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们全家人都着迷于 现在几点以及别人是否知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You went to President Seibert's house in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你半夜三更跑到赛伯校长家里？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:21.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He didn't respond to my e-mail, his phone number is unlisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:21.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他没回我的电子邮件 他家电话没列在电话簿上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Tell me what my other option was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还有什么其他选择
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:26.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You could have waited until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:26.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以等到明天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:29.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know, look who I'm talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.27,0:02:29.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我忘记对象是你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:33.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Remember the grant proposal I submitted to the National Science Foundation...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.23,0:02:33.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还记得我向国家科学基金会 提出的研究计划…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to detect slow-moving monopoles at the magnetic north pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.11,0:02:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打算在地磁北极 侦测缓慢移动的单极
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:40.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hardly a day goes by when I don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:40.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无时不刻不想着它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:42.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, how nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.08,0:02:42.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你真好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, a space opened up at the last minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}国家科学基金会的北极探险队
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:48.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on the NSF expedition to the Arctic Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:48.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}刚好有个空缺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.63,0:02:52.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[TOILET FLUSHES]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:55.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He offered to send you to the North Pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:55.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说要送你去北极？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:58.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes. In fact, he was quite enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:58.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 事实上 他相当热心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:02.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He said, "Frankly, if I could send you tonight, I would."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:02.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他说 老实说 如果能今晚送你去 我二话都不会说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, do you wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.06,0:03:06.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 你想去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:09.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course not. I'm a theoretical physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:09.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然不想 我是个理论物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:13.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A career I chose in no small part because it's indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:13.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我选择这个职业生涯 因为只要待在室内就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if I'm able to detect slow-moving magnetic monopoles there...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.69,0:03:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是 如果我能侦测到 缓慢移动的地磁单极…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:20.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I will be the scientist who confirmed string theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.41,0:03:20.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我将成为证实弦理论的科学家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And people will write books about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别人会写书介绍我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:27.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Third graders will create macaroni-art dioramas depicting scenes from my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.33,0:03:27.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小学生会用通心粉 做立体图 描述我的一生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:32.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure. Maybe a tableau of me trying to pummel you to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:32.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许做个实像画 描述我用拳头把你打死的情景
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sarcasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.00,0:03:34.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在挖苦我？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:36.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:36.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有此可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:39.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am on the horns of a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:39.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我身处进退两难的困境里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:43.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you imagine me, Sheldon Cooper, at the North Pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:43.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能想像我 谢尔顿库珀在北极吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:45.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Easy peasy. I'm doing it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:45.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}小事一桩 我现在就是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:49.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not good with cold, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:49.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无法对付寒冷 莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How often have we had to leave a movie theater...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:51.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}多少次我们得提早离开戏院…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:55.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because I got a headache from drinking the Icee too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:55.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只因为我喝冷饮太快导致头痛？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I can't go. -Then don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我不能去 -那么就别去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:04:01.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can you say that? The scientific opportunity of a lifetime presents itself...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:04:01.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎能这么说？ 这是千载难逢的科学机会…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:04.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...my best friend says, "Don't go."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:04.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最好的朋友却说：“别去”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:07.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-All right, then go. -Listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:07.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 那就去 -听听你说的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:11.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can I possibly go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:11.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怎么有办法去？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are the words I can say now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.83,0:04:13.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我现在能说些什么话…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to end this conversation and let me go back to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能让你闭嘴 好让我回去睡觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:21.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Odd. President Seibert posed the exact same question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:21.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真奇怪 赛柏校长也问了同样问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How was it resolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}后来怎么解决的？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:29.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It wasn't. His wife set their dogs on me and rendered the question moot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:29.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}悬而未决 他太太放狗咬我 我没机会回答
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just imagine. If he says yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}试想 如果他说行…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:36.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we'll have an entire summer without Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.36,0:04:36.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们整个暑假都不必看到谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could play outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以在外面玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:44.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We could sit on the left side of the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:44.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以坐在沙发椅左边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could use the bathroom at 8:20.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:46.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我可以在8点20分上厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Our dreams are very small, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的梦想好小 不是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:59.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good news, gentlemen. I have tentatively accepted--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:59.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好消息 各位 我已经暂时接受…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:01.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}ALL: Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:08.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}--the invitation to join the Arctic expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:08.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}参加北极探险队的邀请
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:11.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's not gonna be the same without you. -We're gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:11.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你不在 一切都会不一样 -我们会想你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:15.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you, but your sentiments may be premature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:15.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢 但你们别高兴得太快
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:17.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I don't like where this is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:17.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不喜欢他的弦外之音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I would like to propose...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.15,0:05:20.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想要提议…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:23.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that the three of you accompany me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.03,0:05:23.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请你们三位陪我去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:27.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-To the North Pole? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:27.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-去北极？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is this just so we won't touch your stuff while you're away?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不希望我们翻你的东西才使出这招？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:34.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll admit that was a concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:34.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我承认这也是原因之一
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:39.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But the fact is, I'll need a support team and the three of you are my first choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:39.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 我需要支援团队 而你们三位是我的优先选择
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Really? -Others might be more qualified...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:42.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真的？ -其他人或许更有资格
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:45.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but the thought of interviewing them gave me a stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:45.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但只要想到跟他们面谈 我就胃痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know I'm proposing an enormous undertaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我晓得我提出了一项庞大的任务…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:51.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so why don't you take a few moments to discuss it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.81,0:05:51.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因此你们不妨花点时间讨论一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:56.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not really gonna go to the North Pole with him, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.77,0:05:56.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不打算真的跟他去北极 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: I'm still within earshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还听得到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:02.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You may wanna wait for my door to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.82,0:06:02.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许先等我关上门
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:04.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:07.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're not really gonna go to the North Pole with him, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:07.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不打算真的跟他去北极 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:11.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on, let's talk about it. This is a National Science Foundation expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:11.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢着 先讨论一下 这可是国家科学基金会探险队
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:13.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know how we can turn it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.54,0:06:13.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不晓得该怎么拒绝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:17.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Easy. Instead of saying, "No, we don't wanna go on an NSF expedition," say:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:17.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}简单 与其说 不 我们不想参加科学探险队…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:21.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"No, we don't wanna spend three months stuck in a cabin in the Arctic Circle...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:21.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}倒不如说 不 我们不想花三个月时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with an anal nutbag."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟一个固执的疯子挤在北极小屋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But if we were part of the team that confirmed string theory...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但如果我们成为证实弦理论团队的一员
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:31.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we could drink for free in any bar, in any college town...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:31.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们可以在任何一个大学城的酒吧里 免费喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:35.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with a university that has a strong science program.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.35,0:06:35.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大学里还有超强的科学计划
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Howard, this is big science. You could be the engineer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}霍华德 这是科学大课题 你可以成为…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:41.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who builds the equipment that puts us on the cover of magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:41.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}打造设备的工程师 让我们跃上杂志封面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I could also be the engineer who builds the crossbow that kills Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.07,0:06:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我同时也可以成为打造十字弓 杀死谢尔顿的工程师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:53.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You still might get on a magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:53.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还是可以上杂志
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:58.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You guys are seriously considering this? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们当真在考虑这件事？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:02.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You think you can put up with Sheldon? -Well, I'm a Hindu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:02.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你认为你能忍受谢尔顿？ -我是个印度教徒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:07.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My religion teaches that if we suffer in this life, we are rewarded in the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:07.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的宗教教导我们 如果这辈子受苦下辈子就会有福报
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:10.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Three months at the North Pole with Sheldon...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:10.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只要跟谢尔顿在北极待三个月
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:14.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I'm reborn as a well-hung billionaire with wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:14.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我就可以重生成为有翅膀的亿万富翁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:23.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, gentlemen, have you reached a decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:23.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 你们的决定如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:27.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm in. -Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我参加 -我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:30.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Damn it. Peer pressure. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:30.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}该死的同侪压力 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:35.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excellent. And just an FYI, as I am the expedition's team leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:35.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}太好了 先提醒一下 既然我是这次探险的领队
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:39.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...protocol dictates that be phrased, "Fine, sir."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:39.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我规定你得回答“是的 阁下”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:42.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But don't worry, there will be a briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:42.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不过别担心 我会先做简报
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:47.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pssh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:52.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:52.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:53.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:54.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:54.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:04.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny? [KNOCKING] Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:04.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 -谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:06.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny. [KNOCKING] Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:06.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 -谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:08.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny. [KNOCKING] Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:08.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 -谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:10.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny. [KNOCKING] Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:10.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 -谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What do you want? -I need access...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你要做什么？ -我需要进入…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:17.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to the Cheesecake Factory's walk-in freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.99,0:08:17.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}芝乐坊的大冷冻库
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, I already told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的 我已经告诉过你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:22.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...the hamburger meat is fresh and stored at a safe temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:22.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}汉堡肉很新鲜 而且贮存在安全的温度范围
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:28.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, this is to train for a three-month expedition to the magnetic north pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.13,0:08:28.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 这是为了要训练 到地磁北极探险三个月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:30.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:30.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:33.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know how that sentence could possibly confuse you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真不晓得这句话 哪里会让你搞不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but to elaborate, I am going to the Arctic Circle...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进一步说明…我要跟莱纳德…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...with Leonard, Wolowitz, and Koothrappali.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沃洛维茨 以及库萨帕里 到北极圈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:42.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You're all going? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:42.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你们都要去？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:43.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-For three months? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:43.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-长达三个月？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}恕我告辞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, is that a yes or a no on the freezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等等 冷冻库的事到底行不行？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:53.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That woman has the attention span of a gnat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.32,0:08:53.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个女人的注意力跟蚊子一样短
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:57.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard. Sheldon says you're going to the North Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.41,0:08:57.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 莱纳德 谢尔顿说你们要去北极
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Pretty cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.87,0:08:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 很酷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:02.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'm just a little surprised you didn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:02.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是有点惊讶 你都没告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, it all happened kind of fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切都发生太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:07.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And we had to get physicals and buy thermal underwear...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:07.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们得去做健康检查 还要买保暖内衣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:10.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and study up on, you know, snow and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:10.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以及学习跟雪有关的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sorry, I was gonna tell you. -No, you don't have to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉 我本来想告诉你 -不 你不必道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:18.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no reason you have to tell me. I was just surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:18.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没有必须告诉我的理由 我只是惊讶而已
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You were busy, you were surprised, all very fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.35,0:09:21.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很忙 你很惊讶 一切都太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, where do we stand on the freezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.27,0:09:23.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}冷冻库的事到底成不成？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is he serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.15,0:09:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是说真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, it would help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.77,0:09:27.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上 这有所帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:30.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:30.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我来想想办法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:33.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, wow, three months at the North Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:33.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么 在北极三个月…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Wow, that is awesome. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-真是太棒了 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:42.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry but at what point do you put this "see what you can do" plan into action?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:42.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 关于冷冻库 你打算何时开始付诸行动？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:48.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just a warning, Sheldon. The freezer locks from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.46,0:09:48.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}先警告你 谢尔顿 冷冻库是从外面上锁的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:57.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Did she seem upset to you? -No. Did she seem upset to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:57.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你觉得她有不高兴吗？ -没有 你觉得她有不高兴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -Oh, good, I got it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.43,0:09:59.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没有 -很好 我答对了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:03.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不高兴吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:05.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:08.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Two for two. I'm on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:08.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连续答对两题 我真行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:14.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's not my girlfriend but wouldn't you think she'd feel a little bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.32,0:10:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她虽不是我女友 但你不觉得她应该有点难过…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:16.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that I'm gonna be gone for the whole summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:16.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毕竟我整个暑假都不在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:19.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That feels like a bonus question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.03,0:10:19.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这听起来是加分题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna stop here while I'm ahead but I've had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然我领先 我就此打住 玩得很愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:39.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, and the purpose of this drill is to acclimate us to the use of tools...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:39.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 这次演习目的在于 让我们熟悉在极端气温下使用工具
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:43.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in extreme temperatures such as we will face in the Arctic Circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:43.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}例如我们会在北极圈遇到的情形
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then where are your tools?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的工具在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:46.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:50.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, team, open up your practice kits.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:50.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 团队 打开你们的练习套件
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}As the university did not permit me to bring the equipment we'll be using...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.36,0:10:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然学校不让我将实际设备…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:58.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to the Cheesecake Factory, because apparently, I'm ridiculous...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:58.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}带来芝乐坊 因为我…显然荒谬至极
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:02.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I've provided substitutes which will exercise your fine motor skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:02.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已提供 能够练习你们运动技巧的替代品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:06.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, you will be doing a series of complex mathematical problems...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:06.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 你将进行 一系列复杂的数学问题
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on a vintage Casio model 1175 calculator watch I received...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:10.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}利用这个老式卡西欧1175型计算机手表
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:14.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when I won the Earth Science medal in third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:14.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我小学三年级 赢得地球科学奖章的奖品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Treat it with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.26,0:11:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请待之以尊敬态度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:22.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Raj, you will be painting sideburns and a Vandyke...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:22.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉 你将在精灵勒苟拉斯的 15厘米高小雕像上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:25.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on a 6-inch figurine of Legolas the Elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:25.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}替他漆上两鬓跟尖鬓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:29.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, remember, a Vandyke is a goatee without a mustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.44,0:11:29.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}记住 所谓尖鬓 指的是山羊胡子少了八字胡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:34.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wolowitz, you will be completing a series of delicate surgical procedures...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:34.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}沃洛维茨 你将在 典型的儿童游戏《同心协力》上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:38.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...on the classic children's game, Operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.90,0:11:38.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}完成一系列精巧的手术程序
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:47.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}To begin with, you will remove funny bone for $200.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.33,0:11:47.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一开始 去除尺骨端 可以获得两百元
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For this, I went to MIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我居然为了这个去上麻省理工学院
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:53.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:53.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}计时开始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:57.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[GRUNTING &amp; GAGGING]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:01.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I swallowed some paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:01.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我吞下一些油漆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:04.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't press any of the buttons with my gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:04.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我无法戴着手套按键
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:08.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:08.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真该死
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:11.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Adversity is to be expected. Continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.35,0:12:11.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}逆境总是难免 请继续
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[BUZZ]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:14.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真糟糕 我会被告吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.36,0:12:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, boy, am I gonna get sued.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:17.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Okay, I can't do this. -Me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.19,0:12:17.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好吧 我办不到 -我也办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:20.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Gentlemen, use your imagination. Innovate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:20.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 运用你们的想像力 想想如何创新
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did Han Solo let Luke Skywalker freeze to death on the ice planet of Hoth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.20,0:12:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}难道汉索洛让卢克天行者 在冰冷的霍斯星球冻死吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:30.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, he cut open a tauntaun and used its internal body heat to warm him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:30.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 他切开冬冬兽的身体 用它内部的体温 替他保暖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:33.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You heard the man. Hold him down and I'll cut him open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:33.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们听到他说的了 快压住他 我来切开他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hang on. I know I don't possess the tools of leadership, but I don't understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢着 我知道我不具备领导才能 但我不懂的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:42.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...why we can't assemble the equipment inside the hut and then take it outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.97,0:12:42.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为何我们不能在小屋里组装设备 再拿到外面去？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hadn't thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.60,0:12:45.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不曾想到这点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:50.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:50.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我们结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:57.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here, drink-slash-eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:57.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给你们 边喝边吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:13:00.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What is it? -It's hot chocolate with a stick of butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:13:00.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是什么东西？ -这是热巧克力加奶油棒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:04.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.78,0:13:04.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:06.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In the frigid temperatures in the Arctic...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.41,0:13:06.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在北极极端的气温下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:10.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...we need to consume 5000 calories a day to maintain our body weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.70,0:13:10.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们每天需要摄取五千卡路里 才能维持体重
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:13.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know I can't eat butter. I'm lactose intolerant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:13.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道我不能吃奶油 我有乳糖不耐症
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Way ahead of you. That's an I Can't Believe It's Not Butter! stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我早就想到了 这个是奶油棒替代品
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:20.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But, Mommy, all the other guys are going to the North Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:20.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是 妈 其他人都要去北极
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care what the other guys are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎其他人做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:25.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If the other guys jumped in the Bay of Bengal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:25.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果其他人跳下孟加拉湾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and tried to swim to Sri Lanka, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}尝试游到斯里兰卡 你也会吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:30.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you were standing behind me nagging, I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:30.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你在我背后唠唠叨叨 我可能会
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:34.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't talk back to your mother. This trip is much too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.31,0:13:34.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别跟你母亲回嘴 这趟旅程太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.77,0:13:38.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, it's not. Howard, tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.77,0:13:38.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 一点也不 霍华德 告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:41.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dr. and Mrs. Koothrappali, namaste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:41.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}库萨帕里医生、太太 你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:44.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I understand you're concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:44.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我了解你们的忧虑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:47.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it'll make you feel better, my mother is fine with me going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:47.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果能让你们好过一点 我母亲就赞成我去
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:52.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And this is a woman who kept a safety rail on my bed until I was 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:52.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个女人直到我17岁 还在床边装设安全护栏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:56.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So she has no problem with her son being eaten by a walrus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:56.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她不担心她儿子会被海象吃掉？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's very unlikely, Mrs. Koothrappali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是不太可能的事情 库萨帕里太太
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:02.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If Raj dies, it'll be from frostbite, gangrene, acute sunburn...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.84,0:14:02.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果拉吉死去 很可能因为冻疮、坏疽、强烈日晒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:06.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or being ripped to shreds by a 1500-pound polar bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:06.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或被680公斤的北极熊撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:09.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ma, I'm putting you on speakerphone with Raj's parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:09.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}妈 我打开扩音器 让你跟拉吉的父母谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:13.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you tell them that you're okay with me going to the Arctic?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可否告诉他们你答应我去北极？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:18.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ [ON SPEAKERPHONE]: Arctic? I thought you said Arkansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:18.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}北极？我以为你说的是阿肯色州
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I didn't say that. You never listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没这样说 你总是不好好听我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:23.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He doesn't tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.11,0:14:23.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他什么都不跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He lives a secret life because he's ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.82,0:14:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他过着秘密的生活 因为他羞于见人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Leonard, can I talk to you for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:30.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 莱纳德 可否跟你说句话？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:35.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sure, but let's go out here where there's a little less yelling and guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:35.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然 让我们离开这里 找个少一点吼叫与内疚的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:37.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:37.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I got you a little going-away present.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我要送你一个临别礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:43.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, a blanket. -Oh, no, no. Not just a blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.13,0:14:43.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-毛毯 -不 不只是毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:46.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, it has sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.51,0:14:46.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}它还有袖子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.01,0:14:50.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.01,0:14:50.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:56.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you can, you know, be all snoodled up while you do your science stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:56.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这样你在做科学研究的时候 也可以抱着毛毯暖和些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:15:00.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wow. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.90,0:15:00.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真酷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会想念你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-See you later. -Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-待会儿见 -再见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:20.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. KOOTHRAPPALI: I told you no. Why don't you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:20.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我说没有就是没有 你为什么不相信我？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:23.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}MRS. WOLOWITZ: Because it doesn't make sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:23.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为这一点也说不通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:26.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can it be that in the entire country of India...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.26,0:15:26.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么可能整个印度…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:30.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there isn't one Outback Steakhouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:30.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连一间澳美客牛排馆都没有？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:36.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:42.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon? -I want a cookie, Meemaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.73,0:15:42.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 -我要吃饼干 奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:48.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sheldon, it's me. -But Meemaw just made cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:48.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-谢尔顿 是我 -但奶奶刚刚做了饼干
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen, I don't know if I can go on the expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着 我不确定我是否能去探险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:56.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What? -I don't think I can go to the North Pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:56.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-什么？ -我想我不能去北极
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:16:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Leonard, I know you're concerned about disappointing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.58,0:16:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好 莱纳德 我知道你担心会让我失望
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:03.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I want you to take comfort from the knowledge...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:03.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我要你安心
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:07.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that my expectations of you are very low.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:07.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为我对你的期待非常低
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:10.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, that's very comforting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:10.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 这样安心多了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:12.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Comforting is a part of leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:12.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}安定人心也是领导的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's not a part I care for but such is my burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我虽不在乎 但却是我的负担
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:19.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Terrific. It's just that I don't think Penny wants me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好极了 原因是我想佩妮并不希望我去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:23.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Assuming that's a valid reason not to go, which it isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:23.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}假设你有个好理由可以不去 当然没有这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:27.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...how do you know this? Did she say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:27.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么知道？是她说的？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也不是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But she said she was gonna miss me and she gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:32.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但她说她会想念我 还给了我这个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What is it? -It's a blanket with sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是什么？ -这是有袖子的毛毯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:41.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, that's clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:41.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let me see if I understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:44.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我看看 我是否了解正确
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:49.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her missing you, is an emotional state you find desirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:49.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你很喜欢她想念你的这种情绪状态
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes, obviously. -All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-对 显而易见 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:55.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, given that missing you is predicated on you leaving...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:55.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}若要能够想念你 前提是你必须离开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:59.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...logic dictates you must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:59.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因此就逻辑而言 你必须离开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:03.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, okay, but I'm gonna be gone for three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:03.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 好吧 但我一走就是三个月
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:06.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if she doesn't miss me that long and she meets someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}万一她不能想念我那么久？ 她遇上别人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:10.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She does have a short attention span.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:10.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的注意力的确很短
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:13.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-So I can't go. -Leonard, you may be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:13.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-因此 我不能去 -莱纳德 你可能说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:16.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It appears that Penny secretly wants you in her life...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.53,0:17:16.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看起来佩妮秘密地想要跟你…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...in a very intimate and carnal fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拥有亲密的肉体关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You really think so? -Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你真的这么认为吗？ -当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Even in my sleep-deprived state...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}即使我被剥夺睡眠状态下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:30.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I've managed to pull off another one of my classic pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:30.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我还是有办法对你恶作剧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Buzzinga.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:43.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, Leonard, what time is it? -Seven a.m. I'm sorry it's early.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:43.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-莱纳德 现在几点？ -早上七点 抱歉一大早吵你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:46.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But we're leaving soon and I needed to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:46.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我们很快就要离开 我需要跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.57,0:17:48.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.57,0:17:48.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:51.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did you mean when you said you were going to miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.65,0:17:51.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当你说你会想念我 这句话是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:58.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't know. You'll be gone and I'll notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:58.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不知道 你不在 我会注意到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:03.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, what about this? What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:03.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么这个呢？这又是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wine, a credit card and late-night television are a bad combination?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}酒、信用卡及深夜电视 难道是不好的组合？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:11.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:11.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:15.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What about that really long hug? What did that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.01,0:18:15.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那么那次久久的拥抱呢？ 那又是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That wasn't a long hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不算是久久的拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:21.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It was at least five Mississippis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:21.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我至少数到了五
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A standard hug is two Mississippis, tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}标准的拥抱 最多只会数到二
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:31.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard, I don't know what to tell you. It was just a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:31.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德 我不知道该怎么说 这只是个拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:34.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Glad we cleared that up. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:34.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-很高兴我们能够澄清这事 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:37.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I guess I'll see you. -Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:37.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Have a safe trip. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-一路小心 -谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:41.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Bye. -Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:41.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-再见 -好 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.92,0:18:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:50.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It means I wish you weren't going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.25,0:18:50.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}意思是我希望你不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.47,0:18:56.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WIND HOWLING]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.93,0:19:00.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Damn it. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.93,0:19:00.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-该死 -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:03.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're out of ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.93,0:19:03.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没有冰块了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:07.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, we begin initial assembly and deployment of the testing equipment...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:07.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我们从明天早上七点 开始测试设备的组装跟布置
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:13.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...starting tomorrow at 0700 hours, but until then, you are all off duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:13.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在此之前 你们都可以休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:15.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I suggest you keep the shenanigans to a minimum...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:15.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我建议你们恶作剧别玩得过火
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:19.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...as medical help is 18 hours away by dogsled.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.03,0:19:19.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为医疗支援 要靠狗拉雪橇18小时才能到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you working on? -Crossbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.16,0:19:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你在做什么？ -十字弓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:27.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys, can I just say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:27.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 我可以说句话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:30.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about we take a moment to think about where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:30.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们何不花点时间想想 我们身处何处？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, this is literally the top of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这简直就是世界顶端
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:36.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Only a handful of people in all of human history...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:36.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在人类历史上 只有少数人…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:38.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...will ever see what we are going to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:38.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能看到我们将要看到的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:41.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He's right. -Yeah, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:41.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他说得对 -对
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.97,0:19:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真是了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:48.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So who's up for a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:48.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有谁想看电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good idea. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好点子 你觉得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:53.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ice Station Zebra or John Carpenter's The Thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:53.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《大北极》还是 约翰卡本特的《突变第三型》？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:56.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I say double feature. -Dinner's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.11,0:19:56.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-两部都看 -晚餐好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:59.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: What are we having? -Reconstituted Thai food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.28,0:19:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-今天吃什么？ -再造泰国菜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.37,0:20:02.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you bring the dehydrated low-sodium soy sauce?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.37,0:20:02.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可带了脱水的低钠酱油？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:04.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Check. -Freeze-dried spicy mustard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:04.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-带了 -冷冻干燥的辣味芥末酱？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:08.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Check. -And flash-frozen brown rice, not white?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:08.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-带了 -快速冷冻的糙米 不是白米？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:12.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Uh, oh. Sorry. -Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.54,0:20:12.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-抱歉 -别担心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.21,0:20:13.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.21,0:20:14.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我藏起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:14.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.92,0:20:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Buzzinga.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're in my spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你坐在我的位子上了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:36.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's no time for a crossbow, find me an icicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:36.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有时间用十字弓 帮我找根冰柱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:43.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: Three months. This is gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:43.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}三个月 这一定会很棒
